  },
  \"strengths\": [
    \"Comprehensive and well-structured testing scope and test plan.\",
    \"Thorough functional and form validation testing, supported by correct JavaScript implementation and clear screenshots.\",
    \"Effective documentation of responsive layout testing with visual evidence for different views.\",
    \"Complete Lighthouse testing with scores, screenshot, analysis, and recommendation.\",
    \"Well-organized and beginner-friendly final testing documentation report.\"
  ],
  \"weaknesses\": [
