  \"action_plan\": \"Good work—your testing documentation and code analysis demonstrate a strong understanding of website testing principles. To further enhance your submission:\\n- For cross-browser compatibility testing, ensure you include distinct screenshots for each browser (Google Chrome, Microsoft Edge, Mozilla Firefox) to visually confirm consistent functionality and layout. This provides concrete evidence for your claims and fully satisfies the assignment requirements.\"
}"} 
