      \"feedback\": \"The learner's report clearly defines the testing scope, identifying all required website areas such as the Homepage, Destinations page, Tour Packages page, Navigation bar, Cross-page links, Destination cards, Package cards, Booking inquiry form, Responsive layout testing, Browser compatibility testing, and Lighthouse testing. The explanation for the importance of testing before deployment is also well-articulated in the report.\",
