      \"feedback\": \"The test plan is comprehensively prepared and presented in a clear table format, as required. It includes all necessary elements: features to be tested (e.g., Homepage Loading, Form Blank Field Validation), corresponding testing types (Functional Testing, Validation Testing, Browser Testing, Responsive Testing, Lighthouse Testing), and detailed expected results for each test case. The structure and content fully meet the assignment requirements.\",
