      \"criteria\": \"Functional Testing Results\",
      \"feedback\": \"The report provides thorough documentation of functional testing results for all specified components, including the Homepage, Destinations page, Tour Packages page, Navigation links, Navigation consistency, Destination cards, Package cards, Buttons, and Links. Each test case includes expected results, actual results, and a clear PASS/FAIL status. The accompanying screenshots in the report (pages 7-8) visually confirm the correct loading and display of these pages and elements, aligning perfectly with the submitted HTML and CSS code. The 'Book Your Trip Now' button on the homepage correctly links to the packages page, as verified in 'index.html'.\",
      \"fixing\": \"No fixing required.\",
      \"score\": \"20 / 20\"
    },
    {
      \"criteria\": \"Booking Inquiry Form Validation Testing\",
      \"feedback\": \"The learner has meticulously tested the booking inquiry form validation. The report details tests for blank field validation, email validation, password matching, contact number validation, booking reference ID validation, and successful form submission, all with expected/actual results and PASS/FAIL status. The JavaScript file 'script.js' demonstrates correct implementation of all these validation rules, including `validateRequired` for blank fields, `!email.includes('@')` for email, `password !== confirmPassword` for matching passwords, `isNaN(contact)` for numeric contact numbers, and `!bookingRef.startsWith('TV-')` for the booking reference prefix. Screenshots on pages 10-11 clearly illustrate both failed validation messages and a successful submission alert with form reset, providing strong evidence of correct functionality.\",
      \"fixing\": \"No fixing required.\",
      \"score\": \"15 / 15\"
    },
    {
      \"criteria\": \"Cross-Browser Compatibility Testing\",
      \"feedback\": \"The report documents cross-browser compatibility testing for Google Chrome, Microsoft Edge, and Mozilla Firefox, stating that the website functions correctly across all three with a 'PASS' status. While the report confirms the tests were conducted and passed, explicit visual evidence (screenshots) for each browser was not provided in the 'Testing Evidence & Screenshots' section. Although the website's Bootstrap framework generally ensures compatibility, specific visual proof for each browser would strengthen the evidence.\",
      \"fixing\": \"To fully meet the evidence requirements, include distinct screenshots for each browser (Google Chrome, Microsoft Edge, Mozilla Firefox) demonstrating that pages load correctly, navigation works, and layout displays as expected.\",
      \"score\": \"8 / 10\"
    },
    {
      \"criteria\": \"Responsive Layout Testing\",
      \"feedback\": \"The learner has effectively tested the responsive layout across mobile, tablet, and desktop views. The report confirms that the navbar behavior, hamburger menu, readable text, responsive images, card alignment, booking form usability, button accessibility, and content overlap were checked. Crucially, the report includes clear screenshots for Mobile View (page 13), Ipad View (page 14), and Laptop View (page 15), which visually confirm the website's correct adaptation and functionality across different screen sizes. The underlying Bootstrap implementation in the HTML files supports this responsive behavior.\",
      \"fixing\": \"No fixing required.\",
      \"score\": \"10 / 10\"
    },
    {
      \"criteria\": \"Lighthouse Testing\",
      \"feedback\": \"The submission includes all required Lighthouse testing components. The report clearly records the Performance (81/100), Accessibility (91/100), Best Practices (95/100), and SEO (100/100) scores in a table. A high-quality Lighthouse screenshot is provided on page 16, visually verifying these scores. Furthermore, the final summary (Task 8) includes an analysis of these scores and provides relevant recommendations, such as optimizing image assets for performance and cleaning up unused code for best practices, fulfilling all requirements for this task.\",
