      \"feedback\": \"The learner has provided a substantial amount of relevant and high-quality screenshots throughout the report. This includes evidence for functional testing (Homepage, Destinations, Packages), validation testing (failed and successful form submissions), responsive testing (mobile, tablet, desktop views), and Lighthouse testing. These screenshots effectively support the documented test results. However, as noted in the 'Cross-Browser Compatibility Testing' section, explicit visual evidence for each browser tested was not included, which slightly diminishes the completeness of the evidence for that specific requirement.\",
